WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:33.880
(Noodles No Flour)

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:35.350
After the preliminary test,

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.090
the theme of official test for Super Chef

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.580
should be noodles not made from flour.

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.480
From all the ingredients on Cooking Arena,

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:44.470
I chose catfish.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:46.460
I mashed it,

00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:48.150
mixed it up with egg white,

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:50.140
and finally made catfish noodles.

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:51.630
But...

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:55.390
They're not chewy.

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:56.460
Yes,

00:01:57.190 --> 00:01:59.470
noodles made from soft catfish

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:00.950
lack the most important texture.

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:02.160
They should be chewy.

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:08.670
Catfish Noodles Done Judgment of Fate

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:14.330
Chewy...

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:16.950
Well, the lye you used last time!

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:18.350
The black stone?

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:19.550
I'll take it here.

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:21.010
It's of no use.

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:23.620
Why?

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:25.020
The lye

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:27.200
doesn't work in fish paste.

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:02.460
I know what we should do.

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:03.760
Mao,

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:04.660
there's no time for you

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:05.890
to appreciate their shows.

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:07.090
It seems that

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:08.810
she's going to use gunpowder.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:18.870
I don't know what's under the net.

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.080
They're noodles.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:26.480
It's kind of magic.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.370
She uses gunpowder

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:29.390
to press the dough out

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:30.340
from meshes.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:40.980
That's awesome!

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:43.180
This is the first time I see their techniques.

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:45.270
They're really amazing.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.020
Mao,

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:46.820
I said

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:48.160
it's not the time to appreciate them.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:49.780
What should we do for the noodles?

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:50.820
Tell me!

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:52.630
I almost forgot.

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:56.020
Everyone is in the final stage.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.180
Mrs. Kaminaribana,

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:59.780
participants all have their own features this year.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:00.720
I wonder

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:01.850
what they'll create.

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:02.860
I really look forward to it.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:15.320
They are finishing the cuisine.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:16.950
What can we do, Mao?

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:22.720
Mao!

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:29.660
Chewy noodles.

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:32.500
There must be a way to solve it.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.800
There're not only ingredients from Guangzhou,

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:36.090
but also those from Sichuan, Shanghai

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.350
and Beijing.

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:00.660
That's it.

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:01.630
Mao!

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:11.020
I find it. Here it is.

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.900
Are you sure?

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:15.920
I guess so.

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:18.090
You guess?

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:19.790
Have you ever used it before?

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:20.990
Did you use it when you were in Sichuan?

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:22.470
I use it for the first time today.

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:24.980
But I have tasted it before.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.220
Only once.

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:27.940
But I know

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:29.560
it will definitely work.

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:30.770
Absolutely.

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:06.840
Time is up.

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:09.620
Just in time.

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:23.010
It's midnight now.

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:24.470
Four participants

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.300
all made noodles not made from flour.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:27.550
Now they'll be graded.

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:31.780
Each of you will be graded by other participants.

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:33.460
You need to taste cuisine of your opponents

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.370
and grade them

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:36.810
one by one.

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:38.000
That is to say,

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:41.510
you're not only participants,

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:43.260
but also judges.

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:44.490
Why?

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:46.610
It's so weird.

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:47.690
I see.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:48.780
Yes,

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:50.300
this is the best way

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:52.000
to select the Super Chef.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:53.500
Yeah.

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:55.420
In the past,

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:57.660
we only considered how to make good cuisine.

00:06:58.070 --> 00:06:59.020
But without the ability

00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:00.940
to evaluate the cuisine of others,

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:03.420
we're not the real Super Chef.

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:04.880
The full mark is 10

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:06.680
for each of your cuisine.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.080
You have to taste it carefully,

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:10.190
and give a mark as you think.

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:12.000
First, Che Lin.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:13.720
Other participants, please take your seats.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:16.930
I hate it.

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:18.250
My heart beats so fast.

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:19.770
I can't watch this.

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:21.420
But I still want to see.

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:26.000
This is...

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:31.950
The noodles are so black.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:36.410
They are fried rice noodles with squid ink.

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:39.770
First, I fried the rice noodles

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.280
made from the powder of rice.

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:43.870
And the black liquid stirred in it

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:44.900
is a kind of special sauce

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:46.770
which is made from squid ink,

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:48.210
wine and seasonings.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:52.060
Literally,

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:53.520
(Wheat)
it's a pancake

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:56.230
rolled from wheat flour.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:57.690
(Flour)
But I didn't use

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:59.100
(Flour)
either of them.

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:01.740
With the rice powder and gunpowder,

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.450
I made cuisine

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.230
which fits the theme, noodles not made from flour.

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:07.880
Now please have a taste.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.320
Rice and squid ink.

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:26.330
This is...

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:35.190
How can it be so magic

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:36.550
and hard to resist.

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:39.950
Its taste is so wonderful that I can't describe it.

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:47.050
Mao!

00:08:47.730 --> 00:08:48.520
Are you kidding?

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:50.990
You shouldn’t have made such cuisine!

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:52.020
What a vixen!

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:53.570
I won't

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.120
forgive you.

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:57.120
What?

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:58.160
Che Lin

00:08:58.620 --> 00:08:59.520
made the most unforgivable mistake

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:01.730
for a cook.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.290
You're not qualified

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:05.630
to be a cook at all.

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:08.190
What are you saying?

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:11.170
What's up, Mao?

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:12.790
Why are you so angry?

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:14.170
There's a seasoning

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:17.090
which is not permitted,

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:18.630
poppy.

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:24.960
You mean she used the notorious poppy,

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.350
the raw material for opium?

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:34.590
Liquid extracted

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:35.850
from poppies

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.400
is high in drugs.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:39.890
It's true.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:40.690
If there's

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:41.910
such addictive liquid,

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:43.460
people will keep eating

00:09:43.510 --> 00:09:45.110
as if they are possessed.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:46.820
But

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:48.570
they'll be poisoned

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:50.230
at the same time.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:55.680
You even added this in your noodles.

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:57.640
You're dishonoring the name of cook!

00:09:58.190 --> 00:09:59.890
Maybe I don't know lots of stuff,

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:01.650
but I know I must adhere to

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:02.890
the saying of my mother.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:06.120
Cuisine must bring happiness to people.

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:07.710
Yours

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.380
can only bring misfortunes.

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:16.080
Needles!

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:24.840
You really played the trick!

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:28.320
Is the needle on Mao's...

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:31.690
Mrs. Kaminaribana,

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:34.120
she used banned substance

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:35.340
and inserted the needle

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:36.520
into Mao's neck

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:38.480
to numb his sense of taste.

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:39.860
It’s really a dirty trick.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.390
Che Lin, is that true?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.350
You not only used the last method for a cook

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.590
on cuisine,

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:50.170
but also intended to get in the way of others.

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:52.450
You're humiliating the holy Cooking Arena.

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:54.780
Che Lin,

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:55.730
you should know that

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:57.460
you've been disqualified.

00:10:57.710 --> 00:10:59.360
I decide to deprive you of the qualification as a cook.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:02.040
You'll be barred from entering Guangzhou.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:04.460
Take her away.

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:05.790
Wait.

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:08.160
Get off me!

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.430
What is Super Cook?

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:11.340
Whichever way

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:12.770
making acceptable cuisine

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:14.310
is the highest calling for a cook.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:15.240
Isn't it?

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.050
Did you hear that?

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:18.510
Wait and see!

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:19.970
I will get back at you one day.

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:21.220
I will!

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:27.640
You must try your best

00:11:27.730 --> 00:11:28.370
to make good cuisine.

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:29.930
People will feel

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:31.960
completely happy

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:33.900
when eating something good.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:36.070
So-called cuisine

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.190
is something making people happy.

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:41.140
I hope

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:42.510
everyone can feel such happiness.

00:11:43.740 --> 00:11:44.890
So I try so hard

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.960
to make good cuisine.

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:48.620
When people are happy,

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:51.080
I'll feel happy as well.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.610
Let's continue.

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:58.890
Second, Tang.

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:07.970
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:12.500
What is it?

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:13.940
It looks so strange.

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:16.630
You haven't seen it before, have you?

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.000
It's called Cat Ear

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.040
because it looks like the cat ear.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.720
So it has such a visual name.

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:25.410
It's a kind of typical noodles

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:27.160
from a village in Shanxi Province.

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:28.730
When I traveled around

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:30.190
to learn to cook,

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:31.370
I went there

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:32.110
and met an experienced cook.

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:33.460
It's him who taught me this kind of noodles.

00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:38.720
The main material is dough kneaded evenly.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:39.850
Then I sliced it

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:42.400
only by thumb.

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:44.430
With such challenging skill,

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:46.840
I roasted it up till it released flavour,

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.470
and then sprinkle the unique sauce from Bancai Restaurant.

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:50.970
Its novel appearance

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:51.880
makes a kind of new texture.

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:53.400
It's my exclusive cuisine.

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:56.440
Please have a try.

00:12:58.150 --> 00:12:59.250
What happened?

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:00.940
Why don't they start?

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:02.890
What's up?

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:04.240
Be quick.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:11.190
You're stupid.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:13.370
We don't need to

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:14.540
taste it.

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:16.250
You've lost.

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:17.600
What are you saying?

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:22.920
You'd better

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:24.060
make it clear.

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:25.150
How dare you!

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:27.960
Because the raw material is still flour.

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:29.770
You just change the form.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:30.560
It's still noodle made from flour,

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:31.440
but you don't admit it.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:32.740
That's so funny.

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:36.600
Nothing special.

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:41.170
He's right.

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:43.070
However novel,

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:44.000
it's still noodle made from flour.

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:46.930
You can't win just by changing the form of noodles.

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:48.720
You look too down upon this test.

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:49.950
Common idea

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:52.880
can’t be presented in a spectacular show.

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:53.940
You should feel ashamed.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:56.820
The fatal weaknesses of a cook

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.960
are poor imagination and excessive attention on skills.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:03.100
Tang, there's no need for us

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.790
to give some remarks on your cuisine.

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:06.380
You can come here again

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:07.510
four years later.

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:14.530
They're so strict.

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:26.060
Next, Han.

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:32.430
Is this Egg Drop Noodle?

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:35.530
I cut beef along its tendon.

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:36.480
Then I made noodles out of it

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:37.740
rather than flour.

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:40.840
Fried eggs were taken as toppings.

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:41.930
You can taste it.

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:42.830
It's not bad.

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:46.150
Fried eggs cover the noodles.

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:50.200
They're noodles made from beef.

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:06.470
Nice.

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.300
It's supposed to

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:09.990
taste like beef.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:12.100
But it's totally different in fact.

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:18.510
Noodles and fried eggs

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:20.450
slip into my mouth together.

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:21.640
Gravy of beef spills

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:23.460
once I take a bite.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:25.610
These gather together,

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:27.390
producing such rich flavour.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:28.380
Mao,

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:29.830
you don't need to keep praising it.

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:32.120
I hate to admit it,

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:33.070
but it's so yummy.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.410
It's not a creative idea,

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:37.280
but the final cuisineis so novel.

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:39.840
It's wonderful.

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:41.430
It seems that they

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:43.050
all convinced by my cuisine.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:46.800
Well, it's Fei's turn.

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:48.490
Nice.

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:49.710
I can finally taste

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.020
Fei's cuisine.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:52.600
Mao.

00:15:56.710 --> 00:15:57.750
There's no heat.

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:00.910
I

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:02.760
didn't use flour.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:03.990
I mashed the potatoes

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:05.990
and made them into noodles.

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:08.330
Then I put them into cold soup.

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:12.540
Potatoes become so clear

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:14.180
when they're made into noodles.

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:30.170
How

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:31.860
can they be so chewy?

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.120
Even the lye noodles

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.440
can't compare to it.

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.420
With so many peppers,

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:38.170
it's supposed to

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:39.480
be very spicy.

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:41.200
The fresh soup

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.850
weakens its spiciness.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.690
The texture is so smooth.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:46.780
Fei,

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:49.370
how can the potato be so resilient?

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:50.750
After mashing it,

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:53.160
I pressed it long and thin by machine,

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:55.430
stewed it in boiling water

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:57.700
and then put it into cold water immediately to tighten it.

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:58.890
So it'll be resilient.

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:01.070
If I put it into hot soup,

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:02.240
it wouldn't taste like this.

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:03.530
So I chose cold soup

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:04.220
to match it.

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:07.690
Cool.

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:09.250
There's something strange.

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:11.240
The sweetness

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:12.400
comes from where?

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:18.000
Meili, it's awesome.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:19.580
There're some pumpkins.

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:22.230
Yeah, it's from pumpkins.

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.450
Smart kid.

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:26.120
I just blended a little in

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:27.290
when kneading dough.

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:29.620
He even can figure it out.

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:32.400
It's cool and tasty.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.810
Fei really has something!

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:41.550
Well, the last one,

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:43.780
Mao.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.830
I'm so nervous.

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:47.370
Is that OK, Mao?

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:49.650
Don't worry. I've got everything settled.

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.310
According to the theme,

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:56.510
I chose catfish

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:57.130
to make noodles.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:58.660
Catfish?

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:01.340
He's just a kid.

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:02.980
It seems to be his limit.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:04.980
He made such an irreparable mistake

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:07.240
in the final round.

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:09.340
No matter how delicious it tastes,

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.020
the fatal weakness is that

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:11.930
it's not chewy enough.

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:13.920
The lye

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:16.280
is not applicable to fish paste.

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.210
Does Mao

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:20.930
work it out?

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:23.300
But it's incredible for

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:24.190
a 13-year-old kid

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:25.140
to go this far.

00:18:25.590 --> 00:18:26.600
As encouragement,

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.250
let me have a try.

00:18:54.870 --> 00:18:55.500
Why?

00:18:55.590 --> 00:18:57.520
How can it be so chewy

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:00.660
and resilient?

00:19:00.770 --> 00:19:02.440
It can't be catfish.

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:05.930
How did you make it, kid?

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:13.040
It seems that something is inside.

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:18.100
Every noodle has something inside.

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:19.580
What is it?

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:22.560
It's dried squid.

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:23.630
What?

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:24.510
Dried squid?

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:26.130
Yes.

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:27.790
I soaked them

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:28.680
in boiling water

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:29.910
and cut them thin.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:31.530
Then I rolled them into the noodles

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:32.400
one by one.

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:33.900
I added dried squid

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:34.990
in catfish noodles which are not chewy.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:42.270
Do they all have dried squid inside?

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:44.850
One by one?

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.090
Noodles with both catfish and squid,

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:49.460
pagrus major soup and rolls

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:51.500
make up this seafood noodle cuisine.

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:52.950
All the ingredients are fish.

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:57.280
He

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.070
chose fresh catfish

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:00.460
without smell of sea or mud to make noodles.

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:02.300
The soup made from pagrus major

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:03.320
is also very refreshing.

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:05.440
On such occasion,

00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:06.430
he carried on

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:07.450
this audacious experiment successfully.

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:09.150
That's unbelievable.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:12.160
It's over now.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.860
Next, it's time for grading.

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:16.230
With 10 as the full mark,

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:17.420
please give scores

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:19.070
to your opponents.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:20.230
Write it down on the paper.

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:24.620
Beef Noodles of Han

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.180
and Potato Noodles of Fei

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:27.860
are both perfect cuisine

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:29.040
which is noodle

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:30.350
not made from flour.

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:31.590
The most important is that

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:34.020
I feel happy when eating both of their noodles.

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:38.950
But my Catfish Noodle

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:39.690
should bring them

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:40.860
some happiness.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:43.640
It must be fair to grade them in this way.

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:53.450
Please wait a minute here

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:54.280
for the final results.

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:06.410
It's really hard time.

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:13.680
Now

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:16.960
let me announce your scores.

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:37.460
Han from Dongjiang Restaurant, 10.

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:40.120
Mao from Yang Spring Restaurant, 9.

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:42.610
Fei from Datong Restaurant, 9.

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:49.340
Uh...

00:23:15.050 --> 00:23:18.320
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.320 --> 00:23:19.066
I lost,

00:23:19.066 --> 00:23:22.608
Fei and I were defeated by Han's cooking.

00:23:22.817 --> 00:23:25.320
Even though we had survived this long.

00:23:25.403 --> 00:23:28.072
However, things took an unexpected turn.

00:23:28.115 --> 00:23:29.950
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.950 --> 00:23:32.786
Proof of Champions: The Emblem of Glory

00:23:32.786 --> 00:23:34.245
It will definitely be interesting!
